    "creatorId": "656760621184025",
    "text": "I have been using it with 5:1 SMCs and love it. it is a bit hard to embed due to the wide profile. easy to release under tension, great handle with a lot of control. I dislike the panic mechanism of the handle, where if it is pulled over a threshold it stops releasing. I experienced no slippage with it at all. in order to use at low tensions, it needs to be engaged with a slight tug of the rope.",
